  "solution": "Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>309</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên tam thức bậc hai có hai nghiệm phân biệt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mn>209</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bảng xét dấu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br><div><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a0ef8033b1b107cbd0ef3931c32979d6cb5d023ba21486d1116661644b4ec68d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDựa vào bảng xét dấu trên, tập nghiệm của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>309</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>309</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> là số nguyên dương và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> nghiệm nguyên dương.",
